      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、だが今日は宿屋で体を休めよう。\r\n今から出発しては、夜になっても\r\nナシャトの町には着かないからな。",
        "official_en": "That’s right—but we’ll be doing so after a night at the inn. At this point, it would be impossible to outrun nightfall.",
        "real_en": "Yeah, but let's rest at an inn today. Even if we left now, we wouldn't reach Felicitas by nightfall."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
